\ Fixtures for the module-deps frame template. A word here runs through a
\ cloned deps-and-words frame, so its own name and a runtime-defined helper must
\ both resolve against that frame.

\ Recursive: resolves its own name through the module-deps frame on every call.
fact: stack-recursive ( n -- n! ) [ dup 1 <= [ drop 1 ] [ dup 1 - fact * ] if ] ;

\ Defines a helper at runtime, then calls it. The helper lands in the per-call
\ frame clone, not the shared template.
with-helper: ( n -- 2n ) [ (dbl): [ 2 * ] ; (dbl) ] ;
